{"3353090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bark and Catch", "steam_appid": 3353090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bark and Catch</strong> - a fast-paced game for 1–4 players, where you take on the role of dogs and become the ultimate helpers of lazy farmers: grow and cook food, feed the animals, deliver products, and protect the farm from uninvited guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/a51478a90fe6cbd2870467b4fd0075d5.poster.avif?t=1775655595\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/a51478a90fe6cbd2870467b4fd0075d5.webm?t=1775655595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/a51478a90fe6cbd2870467b4fd0075d5.mp4?t=1775655595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teamwork</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends via local multiplayer on one PC or Steam Remote Play Together. You can divide tasks to maximize efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/ec299b314481be3666bf1630c9591408.poster.avif?t=1775655595\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/ec299b314481be3666bf1630c9591408.webm?t=1775655595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/ec299b314481be3666bf1630c9591408.mp4?t=1775655595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=