</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends via local multiplayer on one PC or Steam Remote Play Together. You can divide tasks to maximize efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/ec299b314481be3666bf1630c9591408.poster.avif?t=1775655595\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/ec299b314481be3666bf1630c9591408.webm?t=1775655595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/ec299b314481be3666bf1630c9591408.mp4?t=1775655595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep the Farm Safe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolves, foxes, wild boars, and other predators will try to cause chaos on the farm—scaring livestock, stealing, and eating crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your additional task is to fend them off by any means necessary: barking, defensive towers, and other structures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/b16923458a3614fcf8641cfdece92fd0.poster.avif?t=1775655595\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/b16923458a3614fcf8641cfdece92fd0.webm?t=1775655595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/b16923458a3614fcf8641cfdece92fd0.mp4?t=1775655595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Bark and Catch - a fast-paced game for 1-4 players, where you take on the role of dogs and become the ultimate helpers of lazy farmers: 